        "id": 2703711,
        "name": "Flashrain",
        "username": "Flashrain",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/flashrain/{size}/457569_2.png",
        "created_at": "2025-04-16T19:54:37.427Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Feature Suggestion: AI Pilot Companions for Alt Characters — Powered by MCP</p>\n<p>Summary:<br>\nEVE players often manage multiple characters (alts) for support, scouting, logistics, hauling, and industry tasks — but juggling them in real time is clunky, repetitive, and heavily manual. I propose a new system: AI Pilot Companions, driven by the MCP (Model Contextual Protocol) engine, allowing players to assign AI behavior to one or more alts on the same account or across linked accounts.</p>\n<p>This system turns your alts into smart, context-aware copilots — not just simple autopilot scripts, but persistent, evolving AI agents that respond to your playstyle, objectives, and environment.<br>\n<img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitter/busts_in_silhouette.png?v=14\" title=\":busts_in_silhouette:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":busts_in_silhouette:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Alt Support — Smarter, Not Harder</p>\n<p>Every EVE veteran knows the pain of multi-boxing:</p>\n<pre><code>Clicking back and forth just to warp two ships\n\nManaging boosts, salvaging, hauling while in combat\n\nMoving materials or market orders between hubs\n</code></pre>\n<p>With AI Companions:</p>\n<pre><code>You assign an alt to follow you, support you, or run a parallel operation — no micromanagement required.\n\nThe AI learns and adapts from your MCP history (playstyle, routes, combat patterns, market behavior).\n\nYou gain the benefits of multiboxing without the tedium — while still needing to make strategic decisions and manage risk.\n</code></pre>\n<p><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitter/brain.png?v=14\" title=\":brain:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":brain:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> User-Selectable AI Models — Tiered Options</p>\n<p>Players could choose from several AI profiles depending on playstyle and subscription tier. Each one is customizable and upgradeable over time.<br>\nAI Tier\tCost\tRole Focus\tFeatures<br>\nBasic DroneMind\tFree or low-cost\tWarp-follow, looting, salvage\tBasic mimic behavior, manual triggers<br>\nFleetMate Alpha\tOmega add-on\tPvE/PvP\tAnchoring, auto-target assist, simple ECM/remote rep<br>\nHaulerBot\tPlex-based or ISK rental\tIndustry/Logistics\tAuto-hauling between hubs, contextual pickups/drop-offs<br>\nTradeBrain\tPremium\tMarket/Industry\tRegional price tracking, passive hauling, smart arbitrage suggestions<br>\nCombat AI+ (Experimental)\tHigh-tier\tPvP\tThreat analysis, evasive maneuvers, fleet support logic</p>\n<p>Each AI model would be:</p>\n<pre><code>Modular — select behavior modules (follow, scan, salvage, scout, attack assist)\n\nPersistent — learning from your activity over time\n\nOverride-capable — you can jump in and take control anytime\n</code></pre>\n<p><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitter/wrench.png?v=14\" title=\":wrench:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wrench:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Technical Feasibility</p>\n<pre><code>MCP already models context and long-term player behavior.\n\nThe AI Pilot layer would operate similarly to advanced fleet commands, behavior trees, and conditional scripting — governed by your MCP signature and selected behavior profile.\n\nData could be cached client-side or hosted securely via CCP servers, allowing both on-demand and persistent background operation.\n\nAI actions would remain bound to legal API calls and within EULA limits — no automation abuse, just enhanced assistive behavior for alt accounts.\n</code></pre>\n<p><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitter/ringed_planet.png?v=14\" title=\":ringed_planet:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":ringed_planet:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Immersion Potential</p>\n<p>AI Pilots could come with distinct personalities, lore backgrounds, or racial themes:</p>\n<pre><code>A Stoic Amarr logistical bot that quotes scripture while boosting\n\nA sarcastic Gallente salvage AI that complains about your loot choices\n\nA rogue Triglavian “echo agent” that grows more independent over time\n</code></pre>\n<p>Players could even unlock cosmetic UI skins or “AI voices” as part of loyalty programs or events.</p>\n<p>TL;DR:<br>\nTurn your alt into something more — an intelligent wingman, scout, hauler, or analyst that works with you, not just for you. AI Pilot Companions powered by MCP offer smarter multiboxing, deeper immersion, and more engaging solo or small-gang play — while respecting the complexity and player-driven nature of EVE.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/original/4X/9/f/6/9f6883a2d7c2ff5ae95e10516f69e0d1cfdda5e8.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/mKbPZ03nC5dsGbnjMna4vJUeJRK.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"4f4e59db-1f42-42bd-b776-847f88b5a7cb\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/9/f/6/9f6883a2d7c2ff5ae95e10516f69e0d1cfdda5e8_2_500x500.jpeg\" alt=\"4f4e59db-1f42-42bd-b776-847f88b5a7cb\" data-base62-sha1=\"mKbPZ03nC5dsGbnjMna4vJUeJRK\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/9/f/6/9f6883a2d7c2ff5ae95e10516f69e0d1cfdda5e8_2_500x500.jpeg, https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/9/f/6/9f6883a2d7c2ff5ae95e10516f69e0d1cfdda5e8_2_750x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/9/f/6/9f6883a2d7c2ff5ae95e10516f69e0d1cfdda5e8_2_1000x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1A1C1B\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">4f4e59db-1f42-42bd-b776-847f88b5a7cb</span><span class=\"informations\">1024×1024 48.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>NPC alt implementation:<br>\nAfter months of crushing pirate incursions, you catch the attention of a reclusive and powerful figure within the Amarr Navy. Through the MCP system, he begins to interact with you directly — sending reinforcements during tight battles, and granting exclusive missions no one else sees. Over time, as your loyalty and behavior align with Imperial ideals,  he assigns you a personal protégé — a clone-born AI pilot modeled after a fallen Paladin, designed to serve <em>you</em>. This AI, powered by your own MCP history and this figure’s behavioral framework, becomes a loyal alt character you can deploy as a <strong>copilot</strong>, smart fleetmate, or logistics wing across the galaxy. It mirrors your strategic tendencies, references shared history in combat dialogue, and evolves over time. This isn’t just an NPC helper — it’s a <strong>living legacy of your actions</strong>, forged into code, bonded to your cause, and ready to follow you anywhere in New Eden.<br>\nBut more than just a tactical wingman, the AI speaks in local — subtly or boldly, depending on your style — backing your presence. In local chat, what it says will triggered off your own words.<br>\nIts tone, vocabulary, and even level of sass evolve from your MCP behavior — a true digital reflection of your legacy.</p>",
